@startuml
' message-component phase2 reliable send state machine
hide empty description
title message-component 二期可靠发送状态图

[*] --> VALIDATE

VALIDATE --> REJECTED : destination/message/options 非法
VALIDATE --> ENRICH : 校验通过

ENRICH --> FAILED : enrich 失败
ENRICH --> RESOLVE : 补齐 messageId/context 成功

RESOLVE --> REJECTED : 路由不存在 / provider 不存在 / 不支持发布
RESOLVE --> SERIALIZE : 解析 provider + physicalDestination 成功

SERIALIZE --> FAILED : 序列化失败
SERIALIZE --> SEND_READY : ProviderSendRequest 构建成功

SEND_READY --> DIRECT_SEND : reliability.send.enabled=false
SEND_READY --> RETRY : reliability.send.enabled=true

DIRECT_SEND --> CONFIRMED : ProviderSendResult.CONFIRMED
DIRECT_SEND --> FAILED : ProviderSendResult.FAILED
DIRECT_SEND --> REJECTED : ProviderSendResult.REJECTED
DIRECT_SEND --> UNKNOWN : ProviderSendResult.UNKNOWN / confirm timeout

RETRY --> ATTEMPTING : 创建 RetryExecution
ATTEMPTING --> PROVIDER_SEND : attempt 开始
PROVIDER_SEND --> WAIT_CONFIRM : provider.send 返回 CompletionStage
PROVIDER_SEND --> RETRY_DECISION : provider 同步返回标准失败

WAIT_CONFIRM --> RETRY_DECISION : ProviderSendResult
WAIT_CONFIRM --> RETRY_DECISION : Timeout -> UNKNOWN
WAIT_CONFIRM --> RETRY_DECISION : Interrupted -> UNKNOWN

RETRY_DECISION --> CONFIRMED : CONFIRMED -> SUCCESS
RETRY_DECISION --> BACKOFF : FAILED + retryable -> RETRY
RETRY_DECISION --> REJECTED : REJECTED -> STOP
RETRY_DECISION --> UNKNOWN : UNKNOWN + retryWhenUnknown=false
RETRY_DECISION --> FAILED : FAILED + non-retryable -> STOP

BACKOFF --> ATTEMPTING : 未超过 maxAttempts/maxDuration
BACKOFF --> RETRY_EXHAUSTED : 超过 maxAttempts 或预算耗尽

RETRY_EXHAUSTED --> FAILED : last result = FAILED
RETRY_EXHAUSTED --> UNKNOWN : last result = UNKNOWN

CONFIRMED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
UNKNOWN --> [*]
@enduml
